t 000179.1.  Few more miles southward, the next major location appears.  At 000181.0, Maplewood is a major location for the Terminal.  From here the regular Terminal goes south to swap crews at Kayne Ave, and the right side, Radnor Cutoff, detours the city and gives yard departures and arrivals direct access to and from Radnor yard to cities like Louisville and Chicago.  The Cutoff runs from Maplewood to Shelby Park double track.  From Shebly the track converges into one to pass the historic Shelby bridge, then it opens back to double track.  From there, the cutoff hits the Intermediates at 0BA187.0 known as Chicken Pike.  The Radnor Cutoff carries the L&N mainline classification of \"0BA\" but meets the main at the same milepost from the Terminal.  At Chicken Pike, trains are staged to await arrival to Radnor yard.  Once they get clearance, speed is decreas...\n\n/home/jinxu/opencode-spawn-pilot/outputs/opencode_spawn_pilot/comparison_v12_single/hotpot_5a85a37d5542997175ce1fe5__single-v12-1777645357/opencode_raw_output.jsonl:\n  Line 3: {\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"timestamp\":1777645382750,\"sessionID\":\"ses_21c14287fffe1Q2RzXY9XCPX4j\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_de3ebdf4c001k4QquKvSqWdjIp\",\"messageID\":\"msg_de3ebd821001zWqjWqLDo4BWn6\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_21c14287fffe1Q2RzXY9XCPX4j\",\"type\":\"tool\",\"tool\":\"read\",\"callID\":\"call_492188b524fe4b40acf79b3a\",\"state\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"input\":{\"filePath\":\"/home/jinxu/opencode-spawn-pilot/outputs/opencode_spawn_pilot/comparison_v12_single/.prompt_hotpot_5a85a37d5542997175ce1fe5_1777645357.txt\"},\"output\":\"<path>/home/jinxu/opencode-spawn-pilot/outputs/opencode_spawn_pilot/comparison_v12_single/.prompt_hotpot_5a85a37d5542997175ce1fe5_1777645357.txt</path>\\n<type>file</type>\\n<content>1: You are a research agent answering multi-hop questions by searching through documents.\\n2: \\n3: Your task: Read the provided documents, find the information needed to answer the question, and output your answer